  "description": "<p>Rothco's Midweight Thermal Knit Top is designed to provide exceptional warmth and comfort, making it an essential piece for your cold-weather wardrobe. Crafted from a high-performance polyester and cotton blend, this thermal top offers the perfect balance of breathability and insulation. The lightweight material ensures you stay warm without feeling bulky, while the breathable fabric helps regulate your body temperature during various activities. Featuring a crew neck design with a tagless label, this thermal top provides maximum comfort and reduces irritation. Ideal for layering under outerwear or wearing alone, Rothco's Midweight Thermal Knit Top is perfect for outdoor adventures, work, or everyday wear. Matching thermal bottoms are available, allowing you to complete your cold-weather ensemble. Whether you're hiking, camping, or simply braving the winter chill, trust Rothco's thermal top to keep you warm and comfortable throughout the day.</p>",
